---
title: "Sequence: Find My Car recommendation"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Customer
    participant B as Browser (rento-ai.js)
    participant F as car-recommendation.php
    participant T as trip-parser.php
    participant E as CarRecommendationEngine
    participant Q as pricing.php / price-insights.php
    participant DB as MySQL
    U->>B: "Mountain roads to Mustang, 5 people"
    B->>B: understand() shows chips (type, budget, travellers) as the user types
    B->>F: POST trip, budget, carType, dates (csrf_token)
    F->>T: trip_understand(trip)
    T-->>F: type=SUV (inferred), tripType=mountain, people=5, context
    F->>E: recommend(criteria, userEmail)
    E->>DB: active cars (with Rugged flag)
    E->>DB: user's confirmed rentals (history)
    loop every car
        E->>Q: dailyPrice(): quote on the dates, else the card's 'from' price
        E->>E: exclude (seats, availability, >10% over budget)
        E->>E: weighted score: type, seats, budget, road (x rugged), comfort, fuel, history, age
    end
    E->>E: sort by score then price, drop matches below 40%
    E-->>F: matches with percent, reasons, cautions
    F-->>B: result cards ("Rugged, off-road capable ...", "Not a rugged 4x4 ...")
